1
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,070
[HERE COMES MISS CHAN.]

2
00:00:09,945 --> 00:00:11,603
(Put your left arm around her.)

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:12,795
Hey.

4
00:00:12,908 --> 00:00:15,051
If you’re going to do that,
can you do it somewhere else?

5
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,448
The upper floors are a hotel.

6
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:17,395
It has rooms available.

7
00:00:18,052 --> 00:00:20,050
If you don’t want to spend the night
at the hotel,

8
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,896
do you want to spend time in jail
for lewd conduct instead?

9
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:30,970
[SHE HAS TO PRETEND TO GET INTO THE CAR.]

10
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:34,992
(Take her jacket off.
Put your left hand under her jacket.)

11
00:00:35,196 --> 00:00:36,601
(Yeah, yeah.)

12
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,601
You’ve invited her a dozen times.

13
00:00:44,942 --> 00:00:47,572
Chan is totally different from Sun.

14
00:00:47,881 --> 00:00:48,913
She is very private.

15
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,670
[WHAT JUST RAN PAST ME?]

16
00:00:53,126 --> 00:00:53,870
He wakes me up.

17
00:00:57,136 --> 00:00:59,649
I shouldn’t have come back. I’m sorry.

18
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,470
[SIMBA IS MELTING.]

19
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:19,250
[NOW, SIMBA IS COOPERATIVE.]

20
00:01:20,870 --> 00:01:22,100
He’s so cute.

21
00:01:23,330 --> 00:01:24,500
Can I touch your paw?

22
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:33,030
[SIMBA IS HUNGRY.]

23
00:01:36,596 --> 00:01:37,587
(Keep rolling.)

24
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:44,700
Okay.

25
00:01:46,665 --> 00:01:48,003
Stop being cryptic.

26
00:01:48,430 --> 00:01:49,939
You don’t grab her chin to kiss.

27
00:01:49,977 --> 00:01:51,452
You try to keep cool.

28
00:01:52,010 --> 00:01:54,329
Play it cool.

29
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:07,297
Kiss her shoulder.

30
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:14,830
[KEY IS WORKING HER CHARM ON CHAN.]

31
00:02:16,806 --> 00:02:18,798
I chose to get the moon tattoo
because of you.

32
00:02:19,492 --> 00:02:21,000
You are my first love.

33
00:02:45,899 --> 00:02:48,420
(Let’s do it again. Cut.)

34
00:02:48,734 --> 00:02:49,798
Oh, it’s the foam sheet.

35
00:02:51,416 --> 00:02:52,801
(And action.)

36
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:57,899
I’ll tell you
when we become acquaintances.

37
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,396
Is something bothering you?

38
00:02:59,545 --> 00:03:00,896
What is my last position?

39
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,400
(Keep rolling.)

40
00:03:02,582 --> 00:03:03,699
If I were you,

41
00:03:04,872 --> 00:03:06,200
I would make a move on her.

42
00:03:06,328 --> 00:03:07,406
If she was that tasty,

43
00:03:07,828 --> 00:03:09,410
I couldn’t let it end
after just one night.

44
00:03:09,441 --> 00:03:10,070
Am I right?

45
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:14,870
[IT’S A SCENE WITH SUN’S APPEARANCE.]

46
00:03:23,772 --> 00:03:24,699
(Action.)

47
00:03:26,118 --> 00:03:29,464
Actually, I want you to go
to the party with me.

48
00:03:29,980 --> 00:03:31,414
Can you go with me?

49
00:03:31,438 --> 00:03:32,787
I already booked a seat for you.

50
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:42,603
Don’t you think the quotation is too high?

51
00:03:43,468 --> 00:03:46,086
I’m just renting space
to open an Omakase restaurant.

52
00:03:46,961 --> 00:03:48,195
I’m not renting the entire floor.

53
00:03:48,985 --> 00:03:51,596
You know what kind of hotel
the Crescent is.

54
00:03:53,169 --> 00:03:54,200
What are you doing here?

55
00:03:57,770 --> 00:03:59,694
Is this your new friend?

56
00:04:02,427 --> 00:04:03,460
She’s just a silly kid.

57
00:04:03,489 --> 00:04:04,870
Don’t pay attention to her.

58
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:19,450
[A SINGER WITH A BEAUTIFUL VOICE.]

59
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:33,110
[THE PRETTY SIS LOVES IT.]

60
00:04:33,131 --> 00:04:34,848
Do you have something to say
to my girlfriend?

61
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,099
I like your lipstick.

62
00:04:44,352 --> 00:04:45,692
It makes me want to kiss you.

63
00:04:49,852 --> 00:04:50,806
(No, cover it.)

64
00:04:51,308 --> 00:04:51,881
(Ready?)

65
00:04:52,857 --> 00:04:54,099
I didn’t see it.

66
00:04:55,411 --> 00:04:59,400
Size each other up to see
who will make the first touch.

67
00:04:59,585 --> 00:05:02,185
When you touch her, she pulls away.

68
00:05:02,217 --> 00:05:05,555
It’s a push and pull game.

69
00:05:05,593 --> 00:05:07,190
Keep going like that.

70
00:05:08,184 --> 00:05:10,704
(She hits her head on the wall.)

71
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:13,083
Your head has gotten bigger.

72
00:05:13,587 --> 00:05:15,137
Now, my head has become nicely rounded.

73
00:05:15,170 --> 00:05:17,003
You like a nicely rounded head, don’t you?

